# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and paste your Cesium ion access token.
# The token needs access to asset 2275207 (Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles); add it to your
# ion account from the Asset Depot. Vite embeds VITE_* values in the client bundle, so
# restrict the token to your own URLs in the ion dashboard before any public deployment.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
